    <string name="disclaimer">Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_summary">TrioMav Pay never touches your money or your UPI PIN. Phone payments use your bank\'s *99# / UPI 123 flow. Tap to read the full disclaimer.</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_text">TrioMav Pay is not a bank, wallet, or payment processor, and it never holds, moves, or has access to your money.\n\nFor phone payments, TrioMav Pay dials your bank\'s *99# / UPI 123 (UPI 123PAY) menu. Every payment is authorised and processed directly by you, your bank, and NPCI over your mobile network. TrioMav Pay is not affiliated with or endorsed by NPCI or any bank.\n\nYour UPI PIN never touches TrioMav Pay. The app does not use Android accessibility services, screen reading, or input capture. You enter your PIN only inside your bank\'s own *99# / IVR flow.\n\nYour data stays on your device. TrioMav Pay receives incoming bank SMS only while a phone payment is in progress, and only to help detect a confirmation. It never uploads your messages, contacts, or transaction history.\n\nBy continuing, you confirm that you have read and understood this.</string>
    
